//@version=6
// =============================================================================
// LucidICT V6 — V5 Java entry chain ported to Pine v6 (single traded root: MNQ)
// Source of truth: pine/src/*.pine  ->  tools/pine_build.py  ->  pine/dist/LucidICT_v6.pine
// NEVER hand-edit the dist file (master prompt R8). Port map: docs/v6/PORT_MAP.md.
// Chart: MNQ1! (or a dated MNQ contract), 5-minute. All clock math is America/New_York.
// =============================================================================
// 00_header — strategy() declaration (Agent 02). Execution model per PINE_CONSTRAINTS C-07:
//   process_orders_on_close = true  (MARKET_ON_CONFIRM fills at the confirmed bar close)
//   calc_on_every_tick      = false (AP-3 / I5: no intrabar entries)
//   calc_on_order_fills     = false
//   pyramiding              = 0     (I1 / AP-10: one position, never added to)
strategy("LucidICT V6", shorttitle = "LucidICTv6", overlay = true, pyramiding = 0, process_orders_on_close = true, calc_on_every_tick = false, calc_on_order_fills = false, initial_capital = 50000, currency = currency.USD, default_qty_type = strategy.fixed, default_qty_value = 1, max_labels_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500, max_boxes_count = 100, max_bars_back = 500)
// Build identity (tools/pine_build.py replaces the next line with: const string BUILD_ID = "<src sha256[:16]>")
// @@BUILD_ID@@
